* KiCad built-in single-pole op amp model, copied verbatim from spec 03-opamp-noninv netlist_body
.subckt kicad_builtin_opamp in+ in- vcc vee out params: POLE=20 GAIN=20k VOFF=10m ROUT=10
  Voff in+ inoff dc {VOFF}
  G10 0 int inoff in- 100u
  R1 int 0 {GAIN/100u}
  C1 int 0 {1/(6.28*(GAIN/100u)*POLE)}
  Eout 2 0 int 0 1
  Rout 2 out {ROUT}
  Elow lee 0 vee 0 1
  Ehigh lcc 0 vcc 0 1
  Dlow lee int Dlimit
  Dhigh int lcc Dlimit
  .model Dlimit D N=0.01
.ends
